DD-L006 (https://driverdesk.dev/errors/DD-L006)

  × `sensor.temperature` needs temperature (`Cel`), but the output is in `Pa` (pressure)
    ╭─[28-L006-wrong-unit-for-class.yaml:51:56]
 50 │ expose:
 51 │   - { class: sensor.temperature, channel: temp0, read: read_temp.celsius }
    ·                                                        ────────┬────────
    ·                                                                ╰── wrong kind of unit
 52 │   - { class: light.indicator,    channel: led0,  write: set_led }
    ╰────
  help: expose the output that carries this quantity, or fix the unit (spec §15.1)
DD-L016 (https://driverdesk.dev/errors/DD-L016)

  ⚠ safety block is not signed
    ╭─[28-L006-wrong-unit-for-class.yaml:41:1]
 40 │     timeout_ms: 50
 41 │ safety:
    · ───┬──
    ·    ╰── unsigned
 42 │   limits:
    ╰────
  help: fine for local development; the registry refuses to publish vendor descriptions with an
        unsigned safety block (spec §14.6)
